 dive headfirst into even wilder adventures.<br><br>And, if you’re talking adventure, you should be talking power—thanks to its capable 1.5L engine, the Jimny 5-door <b>generates strong torque</b> across a wide RPM range, ensuring impressive off-road performance.<br><br>This compact SUV is <b>destined for boundless exploration</b>, designed to provide pure thrill and exhilaration to all who dare to blaze their own trail. With the Jimny 5-door, you're open to any possibility, and every journey becomes an unforgettable story waiting to be told.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-48_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-dOorzJ liFmcT pf-49_"><a href="https://pentamotorgroup.co.za/pages/suzuki-jimny-5-door-deals" target="_self" data-pf-type="Button" class="sc-emIqIH clWrLz pf-50_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dAFaGQ ghivjN pf-52_">View Jimny 5-Door Deals&nbsp;</span><i class="sc-cKXyOM hKXzjB pf-51_ pfaV4 pfaV4-arrow-circle-right" data-pf-type="Icon"></i></a></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-d2ad" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-bcSJDS dsCpLi pf-53_"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-enkJyZ gKpywE"><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-54_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;--s-lg:0px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-dOorzJ liFmcT pf-55_"><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-gplwNw jZQEok pf-56_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dAFaGQ ghivjN pf-58_">Features</span></h2></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-dOorzJ liFmcT pf-59_"><a href="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0606/0258/1235/files/Jimny_5-Door_Spec_Sheet.pdf?v=1700137630" target="_blank" data-pf-type="Button" class="sc-emIqIH clWrLz pf-60_"><span dat