709" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-bcSJDS dsCpLi pf-76_"><div class="sc-enkJyZ gKpywE"><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-77_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:8;--c-md:8;--c-lg:8"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-dOorzJ liFmcT pf-78_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-gplwNw jZQEok pf-79_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dAFaGQ ghivjN pf-81_">Steering Sensation</span></h3><p class="sc-kBRnVi iJhfkH pf-82_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dAFaGQ ghivjN pf-84_">The ball-screw steering system strikes a balance, offering just the right amount of feedback without any pesky kickback. This keeps you <b>intimately connected</b> with the terrain beneath your wheels. The Jimny 5-door doesn't stop there; it's also equipped with a <b>steering damper</b>, amping up its on-road performance for a smoother, more responsive ride.</span></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:4;--c-md:4;--c-lg:4"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-dOorzJ liFmcT pf-85_"></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-08c8" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-bcSJDS dsCpLi pf-86_ pf-lg-hide pf-md-hide pf-sm-hide pf-hide"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-enkJyZ gKpywE"><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-87_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;--s-lg:20px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:4;--c-md:4;--c-lg:5"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-dOorzJ liFmcT pf-88_"></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:8;--c-md:8;--c-lg:7"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-dOorzJ liFmcT pf-89_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-gplwNw jZQEok pf-90_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dAFaGQ ghivjN pf-92_">8 Brilliant colours</span></h3><p class="sc-kBRnVi iJhfkH pf-93_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dAFaGQ ghivjN pf-95_">∙Kinetic Yellow<br>∙Chiffon Ivory Metallic<br>∙Brisk Blue Metall